{"parse":{"title":"72nd Berlin International Film Festival","pageid":69520090,"revid":1375216101,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Main_Competition\">Main Competition</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=72nd_Berlin_International_Film_Festival&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Main Competition\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=72nd_Berlin_International_Film_Festival&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Main Competition\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The following films are selected for the main competition for the <a href=\"/wiki/Golden_Bear\" title=\"Golden Bear\">Golden Bear</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Silver_Bear\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Silver Bear\">Silver Bear</a> awards:<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"32%\">English title\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28%\">Original title\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"20%\">Director(s)\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"20%\">Production country\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><i>A E I O U - A Quick Alphabet of Love</i></td>\n<td><i>A E I O U - Das schnelle Alphabet der Liebe</i>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nicolette_Krebitz\" title=\"Nicolette Krebitz\">Nicolette Krebitz</a>\n</td>\n<td>Germany, France\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#EEDD82\">\n<t